   "label": "f03-leave-race",
   "front": "Why can two concurrent leave requests overdraw a balance?",
   "back": "createLeaveRequest reads pendingDays, adds in JavaScript and writes the absolute value back. Two requests can both read the old value, both pass the balance check, and one increment is lost. An atomic increment or a row lock would close it.",
